DRAKON-GRAF — an extended version of the GRAF language.
The original GRAF language was created by V. D. Parondzhanov.
GRAF was developed on the initiative and with the active participation
of G. A. Gulenkov. Extended version and implementation: S. N. Vesnin.
Redistributions and derivative works must retain this attribution
(Apache License 2.0, Section 4(d)).
Independent project; not affiliated with DrakonHub or Drakon.Tech.

src/text/metrics.js contains glyph advance widths and kerning values derived from
PT Serif and PT Mono (ParaType, SIL OFL 1.1) and advance widths of glyphs from
Asana Math (A. Syropoulos, SIL OFL 1.1) and DejaVu Sans (Bitstream Vera Fonts
license); no glyph outlines are included.
